        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/oriol.ruiz/ontologies/2023/8/beaware_ontology#Abstract"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Marker class for the single global world_state individual, used to hold zero-parameter PDDL predicate values (e.g. operator_present) that are not tied to any single Robot/Location/Surface. Exists so world_state has a real, named class (instead of just owl:Thing), which the generic individuals YAML loader (add_new_individual_to_ontology) requires for its individual_classes lookup.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


